you have transitioned us right into our next question.
你直接把我们带入了下一个问题。

00:12:16.122 --> 00:12:24.789
And people are starting to ask Lily Gagan underscore also asks, did you include real life scenarios you've experienced in the book?
大家开始提问了，莉莉·加根（名字带下划线）也问道：你在书中是否包含了自己经历过的现实生活场景？

00:12:26.629 --> 00:12:30.928
And, you know, is there any truth to this story?
而且，你知道的，这个故事有什么真实依据吗？

